    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.poster.avif?t=1752290248\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.webm?t=1752290248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.mp4?t=1752290248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>*The game will have free content updates in the future</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking from a nightmare and recovering from the loss of his right arm, <strong>Leth</strong>, the protagonist of this story, must embark on a journey through various regions to rescue his older sister, <strong>Isabelle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Game features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> A vast world to explore!</strong> Dive into a land full of secrets, mysteries, villages, and enemies to face on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Accessories and items!</strong> Mythical and sacred elements that allow you to play with your preferred strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Discover powerful alchemies! </strong> Combine different resources to create magical powers. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Uncover all the secrets!</strong> A mountain of secrets everywhere!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Leveling and upgrade system!</strong> You can level up and improve your weapons and armor in exchange for gold pieces at a blacksmith.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Full compatibility with keyboard and Xbox controller!</strong> You can control the game however you prefer.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.poster.avif?t=1752290248\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.webm?t=1752290248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546760/extras/e9f1450e8090465fa8f3e95228bb0123.mp4?t=1752290248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>*The game will have free content updates in the future</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Adventure Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking from a nightmare and recovering from the loss of his right arm, <strong>Leth</strong>, the protagonist of this story, must embark on a journey through various regions to rescue his older sister, <strong>Isabelle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Game features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> A vast world to explore!</strong> Dive into a land full of secrets, mysteries, villages, and enemies to face on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Accessories and items!</strong> Mythical and sacred elements that allow you to play with your preferred strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Discover powerful alchemies! </strong> Combine different resources to create magical powers. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Uncover all the secrets!</strong> A mountain of secrets everywhere!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Leveling and upgrade system!</strong> You can level up and improve your weapons and armor in exchange for gold pieces at a blacksmith.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Full compatibility with keyboard and Xbox controller!</strong> You can control the game however you prefer.</p></li></ul>",
